(dof6-ballistic)
*title Native rigid-body ballistic coast and quaternion stability
*mode rigid-body-6dof
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=7.2921151467e-5 gm=3.986004418e14
*runtime status vehicle reference-area=1.0 reference-length=1.0 inertia-x=10 inertia-y=10 inertia-z=10 dry-mass-kg=100
*runtime status actuator maximum-body-rate-deg-s=3600
*runtime status thermal policy=none

*trajectory 1 ballistic-test start on 1
  *initial ecic x=7000000 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=7500 zdt=0 qw=1 qx=0 qy=0 qz=0 wx=0 wy=0 wz=0 time=0 mass=100 propellant_mass=0
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.1
    *when time>10 stop
*end
